    1. Chimeric antigen receptor T-cell immunotherapy (CAR-T therapy) within 3 months prior to the first dose;
    2. Prior treatment with HDAC inhibitors (except for chidamide) or other small molecule targeted therapies;
    3. Autologous hematopoietic stem cell transplantation within 3 months prior to the first dose;
